### Creer une place
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/places
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "u",
    "description": "test2",
    "category": "OTHER",
    "address": "Test rue du test, Montreal"  
}

### Get tout les place
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/places

### Get by id
Get http://localhost:3000/api/v1/places/d18d1101-8ea2-4e8fa362-c678569024a5

### Update une place
PATCH  http://localhost:3000/api/v1/places/update/32fff225-18aa-474c-b136-4ddce1ccbd9f
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "DeleteTest",
    "description": "DeleteTest",
    "category": "STUDY_SPACE",
    "address": "Test rue du test, Montreal",
    "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### Delete a place
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/places/delete/32fff225-18aa-474c-b136-4ddce1ccbd9f
